# Platinum Emperion: "Your life total can't change" (CR 119.7, 119.8). It doesn't prevent damage, it changes its result (the
# ruling): Bot2's Healer's Hawk deals Bot1 2 combat damage under Bot2's Furnace of Rath, and Bot1 loses no life, but the damage
# was dealt, so lifelink still gains Bot2 2 (the ruling). Bot2's Bolt, doubled to 6, takes nothing off either, and nothing is
# prevented. Bot1's Healing Salve, "target player gains 3 life" on itself, resolves and gains nothing (the ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Show and Tell
Platinum Emperion
Healing Salve
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Furnace of Rath
Healer's Hawk
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Show and Tell.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Platinum Emperion)
Bot2.Choose()
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Furnace of Rath.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Healer's Hawk.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Healer's Hawk > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 22
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Healing Salve.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Target player gains 3 life)
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 22
Prevented = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Healing Salve; Show and Tell
